<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan banks and markets closed Monday.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan banks and markets closed Monday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan banks and financial markets are closed on Monday for the Corpus Christi religious holiday.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Tuesday June 3.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
